{"ref":"BDB, נוית","hw":"נוית","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נוית</span></big>  Kt (i.e. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָוִית</span>, or <span dir=\"rtl\">נָֽוְיַת</span>, Ginsb), <span dir=\"rtl\">נָיוֹת</span> Qr; prob. <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> in Ramah <strong>(</strong>poss. = <em>habitations</em>, but dub., v. Dr <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.18\">1 S 19:18</a> HPS<strong>)</strong>;—abode of prophets <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.18\">1 S 19:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.23\">23</a><sup>(×2)</sup> and <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.1\">20:1</a> (where Baer <span dir=\"rtl\">נוות</span> Kt); <strong>sq.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָמָה</span> (except <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 19:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.19.18\">19:18</a>); 𝔊 Ἀυαθ (ν dropped out after ἐν), so 𝔊L; A Ναυιωθ.","next":"BDB, נוּחַ","prev":"BDB, נָוָה³"}